# chamfer: Build Chamfer TooLarge (16 parts, CADFS). A disc r 15, 4 thick, both rim edges chamfered 2: the two chamfers
# meet exactly at mid-height, consuming the side wall. Onshape builds it; we refuse. For fillet-fix.
sketch s(on: xy) {
  c = circle((0, 0), 15)
}
b = extrude(s, 4)
f = chamfer(edges(between: (b.side(s.c), b.start)) + edges(between: (b.end, b.side(s.c))), 2)
